# Western Plaguelands, Eastern Plaguelands and the Kalimdor errands, Alliance ~54 to ~56 (consensus visits 66-76).
# Flow: fly to Chillwind Camp -> Sorrow Hill (Marlene) -> the fields -> the Writhing Haunt -> Dalson's Tears ->
# Felstone Field -> Chillwind Camp -> the Andorhal watchtowers and the four Scourge cauldrons, back to the camp
# between each -> Andorhal (Chromie) -> Northridge Lumber Camp (Kirsta Deepshadow) -> Tirion Fordring ->
# Gahrron's Withering -> Chillwind Camp -> hearth Light's Hope Chapel -> Corin's Crossing -> the chapel ->
# Quel'Lithien Lodge -> Terrordale -> Tirion Fordring -> Hearthglen and Gahrron's Withering (Darrowshire relics) ->
# the Undercroft -> Darnassus -> Rut'theran Village -> Feralas (Feathermoon, the Twin Colossals) -> Ratchet (bind)
# -> Azshara -> Winterspring -> Moonglade -> hearth Ratchet.
# Optional: Alas, Andorhal (211): Araj the Summoner is a level 61 elite. Of Forgotten Memories (5781): Tirion's
# next task summons Mercutio Filthgorger, an elite, in the Undercroft (done in 06 or later). Morrowgrain Research
# and Morrowgrain to Darnassus (3785, 3803): only with ten Morrowgrain grown from the Evergreen Pouch.
# Deviations from the export:
# - The Everlook Report (6028) was handed in at Chillwind Camp in 04, on the way east.
# - A Strange Historian (5153) is taken from Marlene on the first pass and her husband's ring picked up then.
# - The Andorhal watchtowers (5097) are followed straight by the Felstone Field key (5216). A cauldron's own task
#   (5218, 5221, 5224) only appears once its Return to Chillwind Camp is handed in: Felstone's is done on the way
#   to Dalson's Tears, the Writhing Haunt's and Dalson's after the third camp stop, in one northward sweep.
# - The Arcane Quickeners (13320) are bought one camp stop before their cauldrons, one for Felstone's (5218) and
#   two for the Writhing Haunt's and Dalson's (5224, 5221), not four at the first stop: they vanish 30 minutes
#   after purchase (ItemSparse DurationInInventory 1800 s), and four bought at the first stop had to last to
#   Dalson's, about 40 minutes under the simulator's travel and kill times (10 and 16 minutes now).
# - Dropped: Gahrron's Withering Cauldron (5227): one small quest that needs a ride back from the camp to the
#   eastern border after Return to Chillwind Camp (5226).
# - Dropped the Azshara visit: A Crew Under Fire (3382), the Sacred Highborne Writings for Fragments of the Past
#   (5246, so it is not accepted from Aurora; 5247 needs crafted and dungeon items) and Duke Hydraxis' Poisoned
#   Water and Stormers and Rumblers (6804, 6805: the next guide never returns to him). A flight detour for small
#   quests; Ratchet flies straight to Everlook.
# - Target: Gahrron's Withering and Alas, Andorhal (5225, 211) are taken at the camp before Andorhal, and Skeletal
#   Fragments (5537) and 211 are handed in on the last camp stop with Gahrron's return (5226, 5237).
# - Visits 67-69 merged into one loop: the termites of A Plague Upon Thee (5903) are filled in Terrordale with
#   Tirion's hounds, bats and grubs, and Tirion's turn-ins come right after.
# - Hameya's Plea (6024): the Torn Scroll is taken in the Undercroft here, but Infiltrator Hameya stands in the far
#   north-east of the zone: his key and the turn-in at the mound of dirt move to 06's Plaguelands stop, which
#   passes both.
# - Felbound Ancients (4441, Felwood): its Vial of Blessed Water is filled at the Darnassus moonwell here.
# - The Feathermoon Stronghold bind is dropped (replaced by Ratchet's before any hearth); the Ratchet bind is set
#   in Ratchet instead of in Feralas. Cenarion Hold's flight path and bind move to the start of 06, where you
#   arrive there.
# Carried on: Glyphed Oaken Branch (4986), Better Late Than Never (5022), Mold Rhymes With... (5538), Brother
# Carlin -> Heroes of Darrowshire (5168), Find Ranshalla (979), March of the Silithid
# (4493), Volcanic Activity (4502), The Sunken Temple (3445), Cleansed Water Returns to Felwood (5159),
# A Reliquary of Purity (5527), Wasteland (1124), Meet at the Grave (3912), A Plague Upon
# Thee (5903), Of Forgotten Memories (5781).
# Class quests: Paladins' Forging the Mightstone (8414-8416, 8418, Chillwind Camp
# and the Sunken Temple) is the Class guide
# forever/class/paladin/holy-mightstone. Druids train in Darnassus (Ironforge, where the next guide trains, has no druid
# trainer).
guide forever/alliance/50-60/04-western-plaguelands
title Western Plaguelands, Eastern Plaguelands & Feralas
faction Alliance
levels 54-57
zone Western Plaguelands
next forever/alliance/50-60/05-silithus

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Light's Hope Chapel

step Light's Hope Chapel
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  sethome "Light's Hope Chapel" npc 16256 -- Jessica Chambers: the last guide binds here, so this usually ticks at once

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Chillwind Camp

step Chillwind Camp
  zone Western Plaguelands
  fly "Chillwind Camp"
  accept 5092                         -- Commander Ashlam Valorfist
  accept 5402                         -- Argent Officer Pureheart
  accept 5403
  accept 5903                         -- Nathaniel Dumah: the termites come later, in Terrordale

step Marlene Redpath
  tip Marlene's farmhouse stands on the hill east of the camp; Joseph Redpath's monument is just north of it.
  turnin 5152
  accept 5153
  collect 12894 quest 5153.1          -- Joseph's Wedding Ring, at the monument

step The fields
  tip Skeletal Flayers and Slavering Ghouls roam the fields north of the camp; all the Scourge here drop Scourgestones.
  kill 1783 quest 5092.1              -- Skeletal Flayer
  kill 1791 quest 5092.2              -- Slavering Ghoul
  collect 12840 quest 5402.1          -- Minion's Scourgestone
  collect 12841 quest 5403.1          -- Invader's Scourgestone

